# Lolo Pilo - Unified Everyday Purchase Timeline (3-Slot Sandwich Pattern)
# Shifts ONLY on meaningful story flags (Flag_PiloChampion / Flag_PiloSubSweet).
# Voice: Spry, joyful 1968 plaza champ Duwende. Zero time-of-day words. Zero em-dashes.

label Greeting
# Slot 1: P1-P3 Reactive Opener or High-Price Remark
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	LoloPilo: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}
elif {Global_HighPriceActive}:
	LoloPilo: Aba, apo, prices jumped higher than a championship sipa kick! Easy on my pouch, ha?

# Slot 2: Upfront Utang Ask OR Flag-Driven Request Pool (4 grounded variations per state)
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	LoloPilo: Ay, naku, apo! Reached into my vest for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] and pulled out three shiny pebbles instead of coins!
	LoloPilo: Put it on your lista for old Lolo Pilo? I'll bring real pesos on my next hop over!
	- Sure Lolo, on the lista.
		[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
		LoloPilo: Ho-ho, salamat, apo! Grab [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] whenever you're ready!
	- Sorry Lolo, register's tight right now.
		[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
		LoloPilo: Fair rules, apo! Even plaza games need a strict referee. Let me fetch my coin tin!
elif {Flag_PiloChampion}:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		LoloPilo: Ho-ho, my favorite doubles partner! Pass me [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], apo!
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		LoloPilo: Half-court's lively again, apo! Let me refuel with [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]!
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		LoloPilo: Worked up an appetite coaching big hooves down the road! Got [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], apo?
	else:
		LoloPilo: Undefeated service behind this counter! [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] please, apo!
elif {Flag_PiloSubSweet}:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		LoloPilo: No bitter grown-up drinks for me! Pass me [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], apo!
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		LoloPilo: Still got your candy wrapper in my lucky vest! Got [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] on the shelf, apo?
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		LoloPilo: Hopped over from the mango mound for a real treat! Let me get [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], apo.
	else:
		LoloPilo: Ho-ho! Coins ready on the wood! [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] for old Lolo Pilo, ha?
else:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		LoloPilo: Ho-ho! No need for Tabi-tabi po, apo, I'm visiting your counter! Got [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]?
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		LoloPilo: Spry knees brought me straight from the mango mound! Pass me [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], apo!
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		LoloPilo: Shelves look lucky and neat, apo! Let me grab [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] when you're free.
	else:
		LoloPilo: O, apo! Taking a breather from the plaza bench. [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] please!
[end_timeline]

label Talk
LoloPilo: Take your time, apo! Still looking for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] whenever your hands are free!
- Coming right up, Lolo!
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry Lolo, we're out of stock.
	LoloPilo: Ay, sayang! No harm done, apo, I'll bounce back after Mario delivers!
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Partial
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	LoloPilo: Salamat, apo! Just [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] left on my craving list!
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	LoloPilo: Tucked that away! Still need [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] whenever you spot it, apo.
else:
	LoloPilo: Ho-ho, half the trick done! Pass over [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] next, apo!
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	LoloPilo: Salamat, apo! Write Lolo Pilo neat on that lista, real coins coming soon!
else:
	if {Global_TipActive}:
		LoloPilo: Aba, fair price! Keep a little lucky change from the punso, apo!
	elif {Transaction_SatisfyVar} < 34:
		LoloPilo: Ho-ho, just the thing! May your coin jar never run dry, apo!
	elif {Transaction_SatisfyVar} < 67:
		LoloPilo: Salamat, apo! Nothing beats a counter with quick hands and good cheer!
	else:
		LoloPilo: Spot on! Don't forget to wiggle your ankles behind that register, ha!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Repayment
LoloPilo: Before anything else, apo, real pesos this time! Here's the {Transaction_RepaymentAmount} pesos I owed!
- Thanks, Lolo Pilo. All clear!
	[signal arg="repay_debt"]
	LoloPilo: Ho-ho! Clean slate on the lista, just how a champion likes it!
- Keep it, Lolo. On the house!
	[signal arg="forgive_debt"]
	LoloPilo: Aba! Generous just like your Lola! May double that fortune roll back to your shelves, apo!
- No rush, Lolo. Pay next pass.
	[signal arg="defer_repay"]
	LoloPilo: Hehe, easygoing referee! I'll keep these coins warm in my vest for next visit, apo!
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
LoloPilo: Hehe, trying to pull a fast one on a duwende? I asked for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], apo!
[end_timeline]
